  "flavor_text": {
    "one_line": "Ordered forest wardens who bind beauty, memory, and law into every grove they keep.",
    "one_paragraph": "The Caelthalan dwell in river-fed high groves where every bridge, hall, and watchtree is tended as both fortification and memorial. They keep long genealogies, adjudicate disputes beneath living canopies, and believe beauty without discipline decays into vanity. Their border wardens are patient hunters, and even common artisans treat craft as a sworn duty owed to ancestors yet unborn."
